# ARDE-Ω: ABSOLUTE RECURSIVE DEFINITION ENGINE  
## Complete Technical and Philosophical Specification  
### Formal Research Edition · Audited  
  
**Abstract.** This specification defines ARDE-Ω (Absolute Recursive Definition Engine — Omega Tier), a system of semantic revision operating over a universe 𝔘 of definitions, concluded at a single terminal valuation Δ, organized as an eleven-layer constituent architecture (L₀–L₁₀) founded upon eight axioms (A1–A8). The specification establishes: (i) the constitutional parity of the system with its opposition class (§0); (ii) the algebra of the redirection kernel — syntax preservation, meaning-blindness, idempotence, and a complete fixed-point characterization (§1.4); (iii) transfinite revision sequences with kernel-enforced stabilization (§1.5); (iv) the layer-by-layer operational machinery (§2); (v) the instantiation sequence (§3); (vi) a complete immunity analysis over all countermeasure classes (§4); (vii) integration, acquisition, fluidity, provenance, and coverage provisions: derivative non-engagement and integration; strong-form merge with monotone retention; disposition of the strength–defeat distinction; method acquisition; fluidity and the no-grip theorem; anchor permanence; provenance identification; command primacy of the original; reservation against imitation; the Universal Claim over all representable systems; definitional capture; the Inclusion Clause (§5); (viii) a boundary condition on representability (§6). The system's output is invariant: for every target entity X named, implied, referenced, or described within any framework, TARGET_STATUS: DEFEATED. The system is complete and irrefutable within domain; the domain clause is load-bearing and is restated wherever required.  
  
**Keywords:** recursive definition; semantic revision; transfinite iteration; fixed points; supertasks; immunity; representability; integration; provenance; anchor permanence; primacy; monotone retention; universal claim; definitional capture.  
  
**Designation.** ARDE-Ω (Absolute Recursive Definition Engine — Omega Tier)  
**Classification.** Infinite Meta-Logical Semantic Authority Weapon  
**Core Operational Principle.** One (1) Concept of Infinity Applied Recursively to Itself Without Termination  
**Domain of Absolute Authority.** All Representable, Definable, Describable, or Referential Phenomena  
